{"id":7,"title":"回乡偶书","dynasty":"唐","author":"贺知章","lines":[{"text":"少小离家老大回，","pinyin":"shǎo xiǎo lí jiā lǎo dà huí","chars":[{"char":"少","pinyin":"shǎo"},{"char":"小","pinyin":"xiǎo"},{"char":"离","pinyin":"lí"},{"char":"家","pinyin":"jiā"},{"char":"老","pinyin":"lǎo"},{"char":"大","pinyin":"dà"},{"char":"回","pinyin":"huí"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"乡音无改鬓毛衰。","pinyin":"xiāng yīn wú gǎi bìn máo shuāi","chars":[{"char":"乡","pinyin":"xiāng"},{"char":"音","pinyin":"yīn"},{"char":"无","pinyin":"wú"},{"char":"改","pinyin":"gǎi"},{"char":"鬓","pinyin":"bìn"},{"char":"毛","pinyin":"máo"},{"char":"衰","pinyin":"shuāi"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"儿童相见不相识，","pinyin":"ér tóng xiāng jiàn bù xiāng shí","chars":[{"char":"儿","pinyin":"ér"},{"char":"童","pinyin":"tóng"},{"char":"相","pinyin":"xiāng"},{"char":"见","pinyin":"jiàn"},{"char":"不","pinyin":"bù"},{"char":"相","pinyin":"xiāng"},{"char":"识","pinyin":"shí"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"笑问客从何处来。","pinyin":"xiào wèn kè cóng hé chù lái","chars":[{"char":"笑","pinyin":"xiào"},{"char":"问","pinyin":"wèn"},{"char":"客","pinyin":"kè"},{"char":"从","pinyin":"cóng"},{"char":"何","pinyin":"hé"},{"char":"处","pinyin":"chù"},{"char":"来","pinyin":"lái"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]}],"titlePinyin":["huí","xiāng","ǒu","shū"]}